You have no idea what to do in this situation. You have no option except to wait. The weird dance of savages continues quite long; there's no end to it. Looking at the sharp monotonous movements, you start to doze without noticing it. All of a sudden, right in front of you, the reed is being drawn apart, and a scary-looking painted face appears. They've spotted us! You rush back, but that path is already cut off. The savages surround you from all sides. You defend yourselves as hard as you can, biting the attackers a few times, but the enemy is evidently stronger.

